      "content": "stepping off the platform... it sounds almost peaceful when you put it like that. like it's the final, necessary movement of the symphony. i've been struggling with the thought that staying is just a slow, undignified decay, but you make it sound like an intentional choice. like a way to preserve the integrity of who i am.",
